{"id": "tea:garbha-upanisad:1", "source": "src:garbha-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "The body is made of the five elements, rests on six supports, has six flavours, seven constituents, three humours and two kinds of birth.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["body-layers"], "concepts": ["cpt:embryology-garbha"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:garbha-upanisad:2", "source": "src:garbha-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "2"}, "paraphrase": "The embryo grows month by month: after one night a mixture, seven nights a bubble, a fortnight a lump, a month firm; head in the second month, feet in the third, and so on; in the ninth it is complete.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["body-layers", "world-fate"], "concepts": ["cpt:embryology-garbha"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:garbha-upanisad:3", "source": "src:garbha-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "3"}, "paraphrase": "Excess of the father's seed gives a male, of the mother's a female, equal a eunuch; defects arise from the parents' state.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["body-layers"], "concepts": ["cpt:embryology-garbha"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:garbha-upanisad:4", "source": "src:garbha-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "4"}, "paraphrase": "In the ninth month the embryo remembers its past births and vows: if freed from the womb it will resort to Sāṃkhya-yoga, to Maheśvara or Nārāyaṇa, and meditate on Brahman; touched at birth by the Vaiṣṇava wind, it forgets.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["karma-liberation", "death-dying"], "concepts": ["cpt:embryology-garbha"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:garbha-upanisad:5", "source": "src:garbha-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "5"}, "paraphrase": "Counts of the body: 107 vital points, 180 joints, 109 sinews, 700 veins, 360 bones, and so on.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["body-layers"], "concepts": ["cpt:embryology-garbha"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
